Error [E0205]: cannot write to `values` — it does not have the write-capability marker `&`
  --> tests/ui/param_list_write_needs_write.jet:2:11
    |
  2 |     values[0] = 4
    |           ^^^
 Why: an unmarked parameter gives read access only; assigning into it needs the write-capability marker `&`
 Fix: change the parameter to `values: &[Int]` with the write-capability marker `&`
